## Phase 1 â€” Canvas & persistence MVP (no execution)

### 1.1 Dependencies + route shell
Install `@vue-flow/core`, `@vue-flow/background`, `@vue-flow/minimap`, `@vue-flow/controls`, `@dagrejs/dagre`. Add `/workflow` route in `router.js` â†’ new `features/workflow/views/WorkflowPage.vue` with the five empty layout regions (library / canvas / inspector / bottom panel / toolbar) and nav entry.
