`onConnect` rules from the spec: type compatibility (explicit matrix from 0.2 â€” no implicit `generic_json` wildcard), single-input cardinality, no inâ†’in / outâ†’out, cycle rejection, duplicate rejection. Handle colors by port type; highlight compatible targets while dragging; plain-language rejection toasts.
**Done when:** every rule has a Vitest case; invalid connections are impossible on canvas.

